0..76 Comment "// Two products of one size count the same applications of a free successor."
77..79 Comment "//"
80..161 Comment "// Grégoire and Leroy normalise Church numerals, whose normal forms apply a free"
162..241 Comment "// successor many times. Comparing 256 times 64 with 64 times 256 needs a large"
242..254 Comment "// readback."
255..257 Comment "//"
258..334 Comment "// The iteration applies a free `s` to a free `z` as many times as a product"
335..398 Comment "// counts. Both endpoints read back as 256 applications of `s`."
399..401 Comment "//"
402..481 Comment "// - see: Grégoire and Leroy, _A compiled implementation of strong reduction_,"
482..502 Comment "//   ICFP 2002, § 6"
503..540 Comment "// - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
542..582 Comment "// The free naturals and their addition."
